Tree is -:
non linear
hierarchial
can't have cycles
exactly one path between two nodes
no two parents can have same child
can have 0 , 1 or atmost two children

Examples-:  File systems , html doms , database , hierarchial data.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DFS Vs BFS -:
----------------

1-Depth First Search(DFS):- DFS explores a tree by going as deep as possible along a branch before backtracking.
-Preorder Traversal
-Inorder Traversal
-Postorder Traversal

2-Breadth First Search(BFS):- Explore the tree level by level, explore all nodes current level before moving deeper.
-Level Order Traversal
-Zig-zag Traversal(same as level order just direction changes after each level)



